		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδῐαιτ-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live</i> or <i>dwell in</i> a
			place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ἱρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.41
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμη παρ᾽ ἑκάστῳ ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία ἡδίστη ἐνδιαιτᾶσθαι</span>”
