					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.8.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Crates Theb.
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίνοια ἐ. ἡμῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.608e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴ ἐ. τῇ γνώμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					64.116
				</span></i>
			.</div>
